      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "notice-error",
      "description": "Explicit error message with an actionable retry.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-notice\"><p role=\"alert\">Antrean belum dapat dimuat. Coba lagi setelah beberapa saat.</p><button type=\"button\">Coba muat ulang</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-notice{padding:18px 20px;background:var(--err-bg,#f9e9e4);color:var(--err-ink,#973d2d);border-radius:10px;font:13px/1.65 var(--body,Inter,sans-serif)}.ds-notice p{margin:4px 0 10px}.ds-notice button{min-height:44px;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:600 13px/1.65 var(--body,Inter,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-notice button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#ab601a);outline-offset:4px}"
